{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:AxB_ArtXXXI_4","page_type":"section"},"citation":"AxB Art. XXXI § 4","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXXXI_4","content_hash":"2d0c0df38172238382b0e75559d8d235f190febbe9bc5395b89199b32266ee1d","heading":"SECTION 4. COMPENSATION TO THE CITY","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xxxi-4:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXXXI_4","text":"(a) Franchise compensation shall be paid on a quarterly basis paid not later than forty-five (45) days after the end of the remittal period equal to five percent (5%) of Gross Receipts.\n(b) Except for permit fees associated with the direct costs of the City permitted under K.S.A 17-1902(n) no other right-of-way occupancy fees shall be charged to the Provider. (Ord. 20628 § 4, 1-13-26.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"1553ff36-52c5-5f4b-86ae-5bd69067a8c5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"AxB Art. XXXI § 4","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXXXI_4","content_hash":"a2ce2e9741ffb32b4297e997b2955d27f45485a693f365cc985e14ccc7a14162","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xxxi-4:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xxxi-4:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXXXI_4","text":"(a) Franchise compensation shall be paid on a quarterly basis paid not later than forty-five (45) days after the end of the remittal period equal to five percent (5%) of Gross Receipts.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"cb6aeb96-6f17-5533-a0fe-875142cea0b5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":